# ==============================================================================
# Exceptions: Essential sources, constraints, block designs, and your app code
# ==============================================================================
!hw/hw.xpr
!hw/constraints/
!hw/hw.srcs/**/*.bd
!hw/hw.srcs/**/*.xci
!hw/hw.srcs/**/*.xdc
